**Why commit counts would mislead here:**
- **Marta Kowalczyk** has a commit touching 795 lines in 9 files: `45259fd`, "chore: indent with tabs per .editorconfig". It changed only whitespace, so blame gives it no lines, and she holds none of the current code. `src/Parser/EntryParser.php`, the largest file it touched, is 100% Graham Campbell (363 of 363 lines).
